From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mozixun <mozixun@fedoraproject.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: make the example plugins optional

The examples are not part of the installed desktop shell and pull in
OpenGL::GLX, whose CMake interface adds /usr/include as a system include
directory and breaks libstdc++ <cstdlib> include_next on Fedora.

diff --git a/CMakeLists.txt b/CMakeLists.txt
--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -97 +97,4 @@
-add_subdirectory(example)
+option(BUILD_EXAMPLES "Build the example plugins" OFF)
+if(BUILD_EXAMPLES)
+    add_subdirectory(example)
+endif()
